      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:540-542 defines 'L2fun p.T →ₗ[ℂ] Ha p' for TimeParams; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:148-149 says the inclusion of tests 'extends continuously from L^2(0,T)'. Ledger:2732 and claims.yaml:5147 correctly describe the canonical map. Continuity in the L2 norm is separately supplied by extL2 and its agreement theorem."
