      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:348-352 defines functions satisfying 'MemLp f 2 (volume.restrict (Icc 0 T))'; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:149 uses 'L^2(0,T)'. Ledger:2733 and claims.yaml:5154 explicitly disclose functions rather than a.e.-classes. Null endpoints and subsequent null-distance identification make this representation harmless."
