    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.TimeParams: L:masked-time-completion",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:490-497 bundles 'a : ℝ', 'T : ℝ', '0<a', 'a<1', '0<T'; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:5,142 has 'a=alpha_0', 'T>0', with 0<alpha_0<1 at notes_stratonovich_ham_second_moment.tex:191. Ledger:2734 and claims.yaml:5161 match this packaging without adding Gamma≠0."
