    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.schurConst: E:masked-time-schur",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:567 defines '2 * p.T ^ (1-p.a) / (1-p.a)' under TimeParams; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:150-152 gives '2T^{1-a}/(1-a)' under T>0 and 0<a<1. Ledger:2735 and claims.yaml:5168 reproduce the constant exactly."
