      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:698-701 defines 'Lp ℂ 2 (...) →L[ℂ] Ha p' with continuity bound sqrt(schurConst p); TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:148-149,177-179 extends the inclusion from L2 continuously. Ledger:2736 and claims.yaml:5175 correctly describe the representative-based map, which is well-defined after completion."
