    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.testSet: L:masked-time-completion",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:893-895 requires 'ContDiff ℝ ⊤', 'HasCompactSupport' and 'tsupport ... ⊆ Ioo 0 T'; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:147,173-179 uses compact smooth tests and smooth L2 density, with C_c^∞(0,T) explicit at line 184. Ledger:2737 and claims.yaml:5182 accurately identify these as complexified tests."
