      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:899-901 requires a real smooth compactly supported g, support inside (0,T), and 'f = fun t => (g t : ℂ)'; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:147 refers to 'real compact smooth tests', with temporal support convention explicit at line 184. Ledger:2738 and claims.yaml:5189 match the real test representation."
