      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:438-440 assumes '0<a', 'a<1', '0≤T', complex 'MemLp f 2'; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:142-147 assumes T>0 and real compact smooth tests. Ledger:2739 and claims.yaml:5196 explicitly state the stronger all-complex-L2 result. It implies the manuscript positivity and does not narrow it."
