    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.emb_norm_sq: L:masked-time-completion",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:561-562 assumes 'f : L2fun p.T' and gives '‖emb p f‖^2 = (timeForm ... f f).re'; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:153-154,177-179 gives the complex double-integral norm on L2. Ledger:2747 and claims.yaml:5252 accurately state its real-part formulation."
