      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:787-790 assumes 'AEStronglyMeasurable A' on [c,d] and '∀t∈Icc c d, ‖A t‖≤M'; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:154-155 says 'bounded measurable amplitudes on a subinterval, extended by zero'. Ledger:2755 and claims.yaml:5308 correctly disclose the a.e.-measurable generalization and prove L2 membership, hence completion membership."
