      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:904 states 'Dense (emb p '' testSet p.T)' under TimeParams; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:147-148,173-179 completes tests and uses smooth L2 density. Ledger:2757 and claims.yaml:5322 correctly identify the complex test image as dense. This closes the potential mismatch from constructing the completion over L2."
