    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.coe_eq_of_ae: L:masked-time-completion",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:617-620 assumes 'f.toFun =ᵐ[...] g.toFun' and identifies their completion images; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:147-149 uses a 'null-quotient completion' and L2 inclusion. Ledger:2759 and claims.yaml:5336 faithfully state this sufficient null-identification property, without claiming that a.e. equality characterizes every null pair."
