    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.timeForm_one: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:460-462 assumes 'a<1', '0≤T' and gives 2T^(2-a)/((1-a)(2-a)). TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:143-145 defines the form under T>0 and 0<a<1 but contains no constant-function calibration statement. Ledger:2760 and claims.yaml:5343 match Lean and correctly classify this as an unlabelled calibration."
