    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.re_form_nonneg_of_mixture: L:masked-time-completion",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:260-269 requires s-finite μ,ν, measurable nonnegative weight and profiles, an a.e. kernel mixture, measurable f and integrability. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:170-172 says 'its quadratic form is an integral of a square' and justifies exchanges by absolute integrability. Ledger:2762 and claims.yaml:5357 accurately present the abstract criterion; ledger:2668-2674 explicitly discloses the combined Fubini route."
