      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:357-360 assumes 'a<1', '0≤T' and L2 membership of f,g; TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:171-173 justifies absolute integrability for compact smooth tests using the row bound. Ledger:2763 and claims.yaml:5364 correctly state the broader cross-L2 integrability consequence used by this proof."
