    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.timeForm_eq_prod: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:382-386 assumes 'a<1', '0≤T', f,g∈L2 and equates iterated and product integrals. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:171-172 justifies exchanges but contains no separately stated general complex-L2 Fubini theorem. Ledger:2764 and claims.yaml:5371 accurately classify and summarize this Lean-route auxiliary."
