    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.integrableOn_exp_pair: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:126-127 assumes '0<l' and arbitrary real t,s,c, proving integrability on Iic c. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:165-169 uses the exponential pair up to min(t,s), without stating the arbitrary-half-line integrability lemma. Ledger:2765 and claims.yaml:5378 correctly give no direct label."
    },
    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.mixWeight: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:137 defines '(Real.Gamma a)⁻¹ * (2 * |w.1|^a)' for real a and parameter pair w. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:161-168 has lambda>0 and separate subordination and exponential factors, not this globally defined weight. Ledger:2766 and claims.yaml:5385 match the auxiliary definition."
