    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.mixProfile: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:141-142 defines 'if w.2≤t then exp(-(w.1*(t-w.2))) else 0' without hypotheses. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:167-168 has the corresponding half-line exponential factors but no named joint profile. Ledger:2767 and claims.yaml:5392 accurately describe a Lean-route auxiliary."
    },
    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.measurable_mixWeight: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:149 assumes only 'a : ℝ' and proves 'Measurable (mixWeight a)'. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:159-172 uses the mixture under 0<a<1 but states no all-real-a measurability result. Ledger:2768 and claims.yaml:5399 match the auxiliary theorem and its no-direct-label mapping."
