    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.TimeCompletion.mixWeight_nonneg: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:160 assumes '0<a' and arbitrary w, concluding nonnegative mixWeight. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:161-170 integrates positive lambda under 0<a<1, without stating this everywhere-defined weight property. Ledger:2770 and claims.yaml:5413 correctly summarize and classify it."
