      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:236-238 quantifies over every real T and asserts q.1≠q.2 a.e. for the restricted product measure. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:159 refers to the 'null diagonal' under T>0 but does not separately formulate this all-T measure theorem. Ledger:2772 and claims.yaml:5427 accurately describe the auxiliary."
