      "reason": "Lean TimeCompletion.lean:550 assumes 'f : L2fun p.T' and states 'emb p f = ((toPre f : Pre p) : Ha p)' by rfl. TeX integrated_covariance_foundation.tex:148-149 describes an inclusion, not these implementation coercions. Ledger:2776 and claims.yaml:5455 match the no-direct-label identity."
